Remove Cells With Plan Validation
    [Documentation]
    ...       Purpouse of this KW is to remove cells detected in provided json delta file via selenium without BTS reset.
    ...       Using json delta file and selenium proper cell objects will be deleted via WebEM Navigation Panel.
    ...       Lastly it validates and activate plan without causing BTS reset.
    ...       Args:
    ...       path_to_delta - full path to json delta file that added new cells to existing configuration
    ...       delta_operation - depends on how you generated delta the cell object is either
    ...                         under "added" or "removed"  key
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     ${delta_operation}=added

    Robot log operation                     Removing cells

    Private Remove Cell Object              path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Private Remove Cell Relations           path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Private Remove Cell Groups              path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Is BTS not busy

    webui.validate_plan
    ${activation_succeded}                  webui.activate_plan
    ...                                     timeout=120

    Run Keyword If                          not ${activation_succeded}
    ...                                     Fail
    ...                                     msg=Plan activation failed! Please verify your delta and scf files.

    Robot Log Result                        Cells removed successfully


Add Cells With Plan Validation
    [Documentation]
    ...       Purpouse of this KW is to add cells detected in provided json delta file via selenium without BTS reset.
    ...       Using json delta file and xml SCF file new SCF is being created, next it is uploaded on WebEM
    ...       (but not activated!). If no delta path is provided than provided scf path will be taken.
    ...       Based on that selenium copy all added cells from new to current SCF.
    ...       Lastly it validates and activate plan without causing BTS reset.
    ...       Args:
    ...       path_to_delta - full path to json delta file that add new cells to existing configuration
    ...       path_to_scf - full path to base scf used for delta injection
    ...       plan_to_copy_from - SCF plan name visible on WebEM under Planned BTS configurations e.g. CONF-1
    ...       delta_operation - depends on how you generated delta the cell object is either
    ...                         under "added" or "removed"  key
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_scf}
    ...                                     ${plan_to_copy_from}
    ...                                     ${path_to_delta}=${None}
    ...                                     ${delta_operation}=added

    ${bts_type}=                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                          connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias

    Robot log operation                     Adding cells

    ${new_scf_path}=                        Run keyword If  '${delta_operation}'!='removed'
    ...                                     json_delta.inject_delta_to_commissioning
    ...                                     json_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     output_path=${logs_path}/
    ...                                     file_name=${path_to_scf}
    ...         ELSE                        Set Variable    ${path_to_scf}


    webui.load_commissioning_file_and_check_load_status
    ...                                     file_path=${new_scf_path}

    Private Add Cell Object                 path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     plan_to_copy_from=${plan_to_copy_from}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Private Add Cell Relations              path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     plan_to_copy_from=${plan_to_copy_from}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Private Add Cell Groups                 path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     plan_to_copy_from=${plan_to_copy_from}
    ...                                     delta_operation=${delta_operation}

    Is BTS not busy

    webui.validate_plan
    ${activation_succeded}                  webui.activate_plan
    ...                                     timeout=120

    Run Keyword If                          not ${activation_succeded}
    ...                                     Fail
    ...                                     msg=Plan activation failed! Please verify your delta and scf files.

    Robot Log Result                        Cells added successfully


